 *
 * References:
 * - Notify hook: developers.openai.com/codex/hooks
 * - Protocol types: github.com/openai/codex codex-rs/protocol/src/protocol.rs
 * - Rollout recorder: github.com/openai/codex codex-rs/rollout/src/recorder.rs
